    },
    {
      "id": "d1cdk7up1w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11210,
      "width": 1086.4,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1742,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1006918219,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795639175414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "La VM avisa cuando un nodo se conecta o se cae (eso viene del HEARTBEAT). Te suscribís con\n:net_kernel.monitor_nodes(true) y llegan como mensajes de Erlang → handle_info. Es un HOOK: nadie\nespera respuesta; ahí podés reaccionar (migrar procesos, replicar estado…).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "La VM avisa cuando un nodo se conecta o se cae (eso viene del HEARTBEAT). Te suscribís con\n:net_kernel.monitor_nodes(true) y llegan como mensajes de Erlang → handle_info. Es un HOOK: nadie\nespera respuesta; ahí podés reaccionar (migrar procesos, replicar estado…).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b6r"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1cg0s2ebd",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11315,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 110,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1745,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 951944165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795639175414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b6s"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1cjqj02e9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 11330,
      "width": 576,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1748,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1589172459,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795639175414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "def init(s), do: (:net_kernel.monitor_nodes(true); {:ok, s})\n\ndef handle_info({:nodeup, node}, s),   do: ...  # se conectó\ndef handle_info({:nodedown, node}, s), do: ...  # se cayó",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "def init(s), do: (:net_kernel.monitor_nodes(true); {:ok, s})\n\ndef handle_info({:nodeup, node}, s),   do: ...  # se conectó\ndef handle_info({:nodedown, node}, s), do: ...  # se cayó",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b6t"
    },
